{
  "id": "toeic-p5-1",
  "world": "part5",
  "order": 1,
  "type": "toeic",
  "title": "Part 5 入門：先找主詞",
  "titleEn": "TOEIC Part 5 Basics",
  "summary": "用學過的 be 動詞、a/an、複數，挑戰職場句子的多益單句填空。",
  "minutes": 12,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "多益 Part 5 是什麼",
      "body": [
        "多益閱讀的 Part 5 叫「單句填空」：一個句子挖一個空格，從 4 個選項選出正確答案。",
        "句子多半是職場情境，例如開會、辦公室、員工、客戶。看起來很難，其實很多題考的就是你學過的基礎文法。",
        "這一課用你學過的三個規則來解題：be 動詞、a / an、名詞複數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "三步驟解題法",
      "body": [
        "遇到文法題，照這三步走，不用整句都看懂："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "步驟",
          "做什麼",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "1. 看選項",
            "選項長得很像 → 考文法",
            "is / are / am / be"
          ],
          [
            "2. 找主詞",
            "空格前面的「誰」或「什麼」",
            "The meeting ___"
          ],
          [
            "3. 套規則",
            "一個 → is；兩個以上 → are",
            "The meeting is"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "主詞前面常常有修飾的字，例如 Our new office 的主詞其實是 office（一個），所以用 is。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "職場例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The meeting is at 3 p.m.",
          "zh": "會議在下午三點。",
          "highlight": "is",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-1/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "All employees are welcome.",
          "zh": "歡迎所有員工參加。",
          "highlight": "are",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-1/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Please send me an email.",
          "zh": "請寄一封電子郵件給我。",
          "highlight": "an",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-1/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Mr. Lee has three meetings today.",
          "zh": "李先生今天有三場會議。",
          "highlight": "meetings",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-1/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Our new office",
              "label": "主詞：office（一個）"
            },
            {
              "text": "is",
              "label": "be 動詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "near the station.",
              "label": "說明（在哪裡）"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "我們的新辦公室在車站附近"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "All employees",
              "label": "主詞：employees（很多人）"
            },
            {
              "text": "are",
              "label": "be 動詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "welcome.",
              "label": "說明"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "歡迎所有員工"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "常見陷阱",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "Our new office are near the station.",
          "right": "Our new office is near the station.",
          "why": "主詞是 office（一個），不是被 new 或 our 影響，要用 is。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "Please send me a email.",
          "right": "Please send me an email.",
          "why": "email 開頭是母音的聲音，要用 an。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "She has two meeting today.",
          "right": "She has two meetings today.",
          "why": "two 後面的名詞要用複數，加 s。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "practice",
      "title": "互動練習：多益單句填空",
      "intro": "照三步驟：看選項、找主詞、套規則。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "t1-be-a",
          "group": "t1-be-single",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "The meeting ___ at 3 p.m. today.",
          "zh": "今天的會議在下午三點。",
          "options": [
            "are",
            "is",
            "am",
            "be"
          ],
          "answer": "is",
          "explanation": "主詞是 the meeting（一場會議），用 is。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-be2-a",
          "group": "t1-be-plural",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "All employees ___ welcome to join the party.",
          "zh": "歡迎所有員工參加派對。",
          "options": [
            "is",
            "am",
            "are",
            "be"
          ],
          "answer": "are",
          "explanation": "主詞是 all employees（所有員工，很多人），用 are。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-an-a",
          "group": "t1-an",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "Please send me ___ email by Friday.",
          "zh": "請在星期五前寄一封電子郵件給我。",
          "options": [
            "a",
            "an"
          ],
          "answer": "an",
          "explanation": "email 開頭是母音 /i/ 的聲音，用 an。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-pl-a",
          "group": "t1-plural",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "Mr. Lee has three ___ today.",
          "zh": "李先生今天有三場會議。",
          "options": [
            "meeting",
            "meetings",
            "meetinges",
            "a meeting"
          ],
          "answer": "meetings",
          "explanation": "three 後面接複數，meeting 加 s 變 meetings。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-mod-a",
          "group": "t1-modifier",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "Our new office ___ near the station.",
          "zh": "我們的新辦公室在車站附近。",
          "options": [
            "are",
            "be",
            "is",
            "am"
          ],
          "answer": "is",
          "explanation": "主詞是 office（一間），our 和 new 只是修飾，用 is。"
        }
      ],
      "similar": [
        {
          "id": "t1-be-b",
          "group": "t1-be-single",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "Ms. Chen ___ the manager of the sales team.",
          "zh": "陳小姐是業務團隊的經理。",
          "options": [
            "is",
            "are",
            "am",
            "be"
          ],
          "answer": "is",
          "explanation": "主詞是 Ms. Chen（一個人），用 is。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-be2-b",
          "group": "t1-be-plural",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "The new computers ___ in the meeting room.",
          "zh": "新電腦在會議室裡。",
          "options": [
            "is",
            "are",
            "am",
            "be"
          ],
          "answer": "are",
          "explanation": "主詞是 computers（很多台電腦），用 are。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-an-b",
          "group": "t1-an",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "She is ___ excellent designer.",
          "zh": "她是一位很優秀的設計師。",
          "options": [
            "an",
            "a"
          ],
          "answer": "an",
          "explanation": "看空格後面的第一個字 excellent，開頭是母音 /ɛ/ 的聲音，所以用 an。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-pl-b",
          "group": "t1-plural",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "We need two more ___ for the event.",
          "zh": "這場活動我們還需要兩張椅子。",
          "options": [
            "chair",
            "chairs",
            "chaires",
            "a chair"
          ],
          "answer": "chairs",
          "explanation": "two 後面接複數，chair 加 s 變 chairs。"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1-mod-b",
          "group": "t1-modifier",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出最適合的答案",
          "sentence": "The small boxes on the desk ___ for you.",
          "zh": "桌上的小箱子是給你的。",
          "options": [
            "is",
            "are",
            "am",
            "be"
          ],
          "answer": "are",
          "explanation": "主詞是 boxes（很多個箱子），on the desk 只是說明位置，用 are。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "review",
